==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Etymology===
Derived from the name of British [[executioner]] [[w:Thomas Derrick|Thomas Derrick]], who invented the framework arrangement commonly known by this name to aid in the conduct of executions.

===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɛrɪk|-ɛrɪk]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

#A device that is used for lifting and moving large objects
#A [[framework]] that is constructed over a mine or oil well for the purpose of [[bore|boring]] or lowering pipes.

